   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2}-5x + 5 = 0\">{x^2}-5x + 5 = 0</span> can be factored to <span data-math=\"\\left( {x-1} \\right)\\left( {x-5} \\right)\">\\left( {x-1} \\right)\\left( {x-5} \\right)</span>.",
