     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "This is false. When you distribute in the product, you get <span data-math=\"-x\"></span> and <span data-math=\"-5x.\"></span> This adds up to <span data-math=\"-6x,\"></span> which is not the middle term of the trinomial."
